Milestone 3 Report and Completion of the [FIMI] Cardano Podcast on Telegram for Vietnamese (ID = 1200008)
1. Published 121 Podcasts, more than 31 Podcasts
2. Total 1389 minutes, more than 39 minutes, about the Cardano ecosystem on Telegram, Facebook, Youtube channels.
3. Average 455 views/podcast after 1 week of sharing. (Update here and image evidence here)
4. Community feedback
Results: (Update here)
・94.7% said the podcast met users' needs; 
・98.6% rated the Podcast content well; 
・97.3% said the podcast content was relevant; 
・86.8% showed a significant increase in interest in the Cardano ecosystem; 
・97.4% of listeners would recommend the Podcast to newcomers; 
・90.8% of listeners chose to participate more deeply in the Cardano community after listening to the Podcast;
・97.4% said the podcast contributed to expanding the Cardano Vietnam community.

